MODULE: ExclusiveWorkCompetitorUnannounced
TARGET: ExclusiveWork
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the competing operation skips its publish-before-read handshake
PERTURBS: CompetitorAnnounce

--- FIND
    /\ competitor' = "announced" /\ competitorUsed' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ competitor' = "active" /\ competitorUsed' = TRUE
--- END
